Input: {"question": "Which country is Halka Na Lo from?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 165, "text": "As the sun dipped into the horizon, casting a warm orange glow over the bustling streets of Los Angeles, the sounds of Bollywood rhythms and laughter filled the air."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 166, "end": 343, "text": "In a small, family-owned restaurant in Little India, a group of friends gathered around a TV, their eyes glued to the screen as they watched the latest episode of \"Halka Na Lo\"."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 344, "end": 512, "text": "The show's vibrant colors and energetic dance numbers had become a staple in their weekly routine, a much-needed escape from the hustle and bustle of their daily lives."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 513, "end": 650, "text": "Among the group was Rohan, a young Indian-American who had grown up in the States but still held a deep connection to his cultural roots."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 651, "end": 799, "text": "His friends, a diverse bunch of locals, had been introduced to the show by Rohan's cousin, who had stumbled upon it while studying abroad in Mumbai."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 800, "end": 925, "text": "As they watched, they couldn't help but notice the subtle nuances that set \"Halka Na Lo\" apart from other Indian soap operas."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 926, "end": 1104, "text": "The show's creators had woven in elements of American pop culture, blending traditional Indian music with modern electronic beats and incorporating nods to iconic American films."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1105, "end": 1231, "text": "Rohan's friend, Maya, a film student, pointed out the clever use of cinematography, reminiscent of classic Hollywood musicals."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1232, "end": 1252, "text": "\"Look at that shot!\""}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1253, "end": 1378, "text": "she exclaimed, as the camera panned over the bustling streets of Mumbai, capturing the vibrant colors and energy of the city."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1379, "end": 1429, "text": "\"It's like they're paying homage to 'La La Land'!\""}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1430, "end": 1578, "text": "As the episode came to a close, the group erupted into a lively discussion, debating the merits of the show's portrayal of Indian-American identity."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1579, "end": 1703, "text": "Rohan's friend, Jake, a history buff, noted the subtle references to the Indian diaspora's experiences in the United States."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1704, "end": 1787, "text": "\"Did you catch that line about the protagonist's struggles with cultural identity?\""}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1788, "end": 1835, "text": "he asked, his eyes lighting up with excitement."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1836, "end": 1913, "text": "\"It's like they're speaking directly to our experiences as Indian-Americans.\""}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1914, "end": 2082, "text": "As the night wore on, the group continued to dissect the show, uncovering layers of meaning and symbolism that spoke to their own experiences as children of immigrants."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2083, "end": 2318, "text": "And as they said their goodbyes and headed out into the balmy LA evening, they couldn't help but feel a sense of pride and ownership over \"Halka Na Lo\", a show that had somehow managed to capture the essence of their hybrid identities."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 92, "text": "**Breaking News: Pakistani Television Series \"Halka Na Lo\" Gains International Recognition**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 94, "end": 311, "text": "Islamabad, Pakistan - In a breakthrough for Pakistani entertainment, the popular television series \"Halka Na Lo\" has been making waves globally, solidifying Pakistan's position as a hub for quality television content."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 312, "end": 452, "text": "According to industry insiders, \"Halka Na Lo\" is a Pakistani production, created and produced by renowned Pakistani producers and directors."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 453, "end": 628, "text": "The show's storyline, which revolves around the complexities of relationships and family dynamics, has resonated with audiences not only in Pakistan but also across the globe."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 629, "end": 761, "text": "\"We are thrilled to see 'Halka Na Lo' receiving international acclaim,\" said Faisal Qureshi, a veteran Pakistani actor and producer."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 762, "end": 889, "text": "\"This is a testament to the talent and hard work of our industry professionals, and we are proud to be a part of this journey.\""}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 890, "end": 1086, "text": "Data from leading streaming platforms reveals that \"Halka Na Lo\" has been consistently ranking among the top-watched Pakistani dramas, with millions of views and a significant following worldwide."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1087, "end": 1196, "text": "\"The success of 'Halka Na Lo' is a reflection of the growing demand for Pakistani content globally,\" said Dr."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1197, "end": 1270, "text": "Shaista Lodhi, a media expert and professor at the University of Karachi."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1271, "end": 1442, "text": "\"Our industry has come a long way in terms of production quality, storytelling, and talent, and it's heartening to see our shows being appreciated by audiences worldwide.\""}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1443, "end": 1601, "text": "Pakistan's entertainment industry has experienced a significant surge in recent years, with many Pakistani dramas and films gaining international recognition."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1602, "end": 1820, "text": "The country's Ministry of Information and Broadcasting has also been actively promoting Pakistani content globally, through initiatives such as the Pakistan International Film Festival and the Lahore Literary Festival."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1821, "end": 1927, "text": "\"Halka Na Lo\" is just one example of the many Pakistani television series that are making a mark globally."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1928, "end": 2077, "text": "With its engaging storyline, talented cast, and high production values, it's no wonder that the show has become a favorite among audiences worldwide."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2078, "end": 2282, "text": "As the Pakistani entertainment industry continues to grow and evolve, one thing is clear: \"Halka Na Lo\" is a proud representation of Pakistan's rich cultural heritage and its thriving television industry."}}, "original_cards": [], "current_answers": ["Pakistan", "India", "Los Angeles", "Mumbai", "Little India", "Karachi", "Islamabad", "Lahore", "University of Karachi", "Pakistan International Film Festival", "Lahore Literary Festival", "Indian-American"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Pakistan", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "India", "origin": "coverage_addition"}, {"candida